<title>NETHERLANDS: ATAG LOWER RESULT FIRST NINE MONTHS.</title>
<headline>ATAG LOWER RESULT FIRST NINE MONTHS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     5.53 vs   7.07</p>
<p>    Net profit			    13.8  vs  19.2</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations    13.8  vs  16.9</p>
<p>    Tax					6.5  vs   9.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			     714.5  vs 573.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    29.4  vs  34,1</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial group Atag Holding NV said in October it</p>
<p>expected the 1996 third quarter net result to be considerably</p>
<p>lower than in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
